# =========================================================
# Leg_Hero — 忽略规则
# 目标：只保留源码 / 工程配置 / 编译必需的第三方库
# =========================================================

# ---------- CMake / 构建产物 ----------
cmake-build-*/
build/
out/
CMakeFiles/
CMakeCache.txt
cmake_install.cmake
Makefile
*.cmake
!CMakeLists.txt
*.o
*.obj
*.d
*.su

# ---------- 固件编译输出 ----------
*.elf
*.hex
*.bin
*.map
*.list
*.axf
*.srec
*.lst

# ---------- IDE / 编辑器本地状态 ----------
# 说明：.project / .cproject / .mxproject / .ioc 是 STM32CubeIDE 工程文件，必须保留
.idea/
.vs/
.settings/
.vscode/ipch/
*.user
*.suo
*.userprefs
*.launch
*.openocd

# ---------- 压缩包 ----------
# 仓库内已有解压后的同名目录，不再重复存放
*.zip
*.rar
*.7z
*.tar
*.tar.gz
*.tgz

# ---------- 操作系统 / 临时文件 ----------
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini
desktop.ini
.DS_Store
$RECYCLE.BIN/
*.tmp
*.temp
*.bak
*.orig
*.rej
*.swp
*.swo
*~
*.log

# ---------- 注意 ----------
# Middlewares/ST/ARM/DSP/Lib/*.a 是 CMake 链接所必需的静态库，
# 因此这里刻意不忽略 *.a，请勿添加该规则。
